      "header": "Duke University Religion Index (DUREL) Report",
      "footer_refs": [
        "Koenig, H. G., Meador, K. G., & Parkerson, G. (1997). Religion index for psychiatric research: A 5-item measure for use in health outcome studies. American Journal of Psychiatry, 154, 885–886.",
        "Toscanelli, C., et al. (2022). Measurement of religiosity and spirituality: A cross-cultural validation study of DUREL. Measurement Instruments for the Social Sciences, 4, e11133. https://doi.org/10.5964/miss.11133",
        "Translations from Psychometriglossia (https://psychometriglossia.uoregon.edu/).",
        "ORA+NORA range: 0–10. IR range: 3–15. Total range: 3–25. Higher scores = greater religious involvement."
      ]
    }
